"""zanei — leftover claims a diff just made false.

A fact is a bound (name, value) or an identifier that changed in a unified
diff. An afterimage is a remaining comment, doc, test, string, or config
line in the destination tree that still asserts the old fact.

Exit codes: 0 none found, 1 afterimages found, 2 usage/error.
"""

